    "about": {
      "eyebrow": "About",
      "title": "Sheetaldharshan A",
      "intro": "I’m Sheetal. I build AI agents that work on real databases, and the tooling that makes them safe to ship.\n\nAt Exasol I co-built the Personal Local Starter Kit: one command sets up an analytics database on any laptop, with Claude, Codex and Cursor connected. On my own I built Exasol Studio, a desktop AI assistant that writes the SQL and asks before changing anything.\n\nBefore that, a year at Prayag.AI shipping LLM agents and Python backends, plus a co-authored IEEE paper on AI hiring agents. Open to forward-deployed and backend roles.",
      "photo": {
        "url": "https://itfzpetffxsglwfmnghl.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/media/media/sheetal-sheetaldharshan-portrait.jpg",
        "alt": "Sheetal (Sheetaldharshan A), software engineer at Exasol, portrait"
      },
