      {
        "title": "Exasol Personal Local Starter Kit",
        "summary": "One command sets up a local Exasol analytics database and connects AI clients to it through MCP.",
        "description": "An open-source starter kit that installs the Exasol Personal in-memory analytics database on a laptop, loads sample data and connects AI development tools such as Claude, Codex and Cursor through a read-only MCP login. Co-built with one other engineer at Exasol; my parts are listed below.",
        "kind": "contribution",
        "category": "Developer tool",
